## Rules

1. Prefer tokens over hardcoded `#000` / `#0c0c0e` / SaaS gray ladders in dark UI.
2. Soft forest ink (`#F5F8F6`) — not pure white body text.
3. Deep Festag blue primary CTAs (`#295CFF`) with slight gradient + soft blue glow shadow.
4. Quiet hairlines (`--festag-night-line` ~6% white) — dividers at 4%.
5. Calm semantics (`#2FA56E` / `#D6A34F` / `#D86060` / `#4F8BFF`).
6. Cards radius `20px`, buttons `14px`, motion `220ms ease-out`.
7. Atmospheric shadows (`rgba(18,40,35,…)` / soft black), never harsh black walls.
8. Selected sidebar = deep blue fill + white icon + soft primary glow.

## Do not

- Reintroduce pure `#000000` canvas or pure `#FFFFFF` body text in dark
- Soft cool-white (`#F0F2F5`) primary CTAs in dark (portal uses deep blue)
- Neon / saturated status colors
- Harsh borders or noisy gradients
- Fork a second black ladder in auth/Tagro/popup (inherit from html)
